{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#card-zh","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 是一个 DSH 插件，用于在本地 AI 陪伴工作流中协调 GPU。它通过 Cordis 注册状态查询、获取和释放三个工具，并由 Python daemon 调用共享协调器管理本地进程。主要功能包括为生图或语音任务释放显存、按 profile 启动所需服务、等待图像队列完成后恢复本地 LLM，以及查询当前服务和租约状态。适合在一张显卡上运行本地模型、TTS 与 ComfyUI 的 DSH 用户。使用前需准备 Python 和描述本机服务的 JSON profile，不需要额外账号或 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:180-241","dsh-plugin/daemon.py:25-46","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:311-372","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:415-465"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#card-en","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"VRAM Switcher coordinates local LLM, TTS, and image services on one GPU from DSH. Cordis tools report status, acquire a timed lease, and release it. A Python daemon starts configured services, drains image queues, and restores the LLM. Setup needs Python and a local JSON profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:180-241","dsh-plugin/daemon.py:25-46","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:311-372","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:415-465"]}
