{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#feature-1","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 的功能「查询状态」：查看本机服务和活动租约。调用 DSH 的 vram_status 工具即可返回当前协调器状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:195-204","vram_switcher/service.py:58-71"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#feature-2","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 的功能「申请 GPU」：为 image 或 tts 模式取得有时限的租约。调用 vram_acquire 后，协调器准备对应服务并记录租约。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:205-226","vram_switcher/service.py:73-135"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#feature-3","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 的功能「释放并恢复」：任务结束时调用 vram_release，协调器按配置停止临时服务、排空图像队列并恢复本地 LLM。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:228-241","vram_switcher/service.py:148-171","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:415-465"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#feature-4","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 的功能「自动语音交接」：AstrBot 侧观察 busy/ready 标记，在语音合成期间准备 TTS 服务并在完成后恢复其它服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:127-155","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:489-518"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#feature-5","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 的功能「共享协调锁」：让 DSH 与 AstrBot 的服务切换任务排队执行，避免两个宿主同时操作同一组本地服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:65-69","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:286-309"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#caveat-1","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 使用前须知：需先填写 JSON profile 中的本机服务路径、端口与启动参数，否则协调器无法准备对应服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["vram_switcher/config.py:266-299","dsh-plugin/index.js:185-193"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaoxiao150__vram-switcher#caveat-2","repo":"xiaoxiao150/vram-switcher","commit":"25effaccc98f8e33ad16bce2242bb802db0e4555","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"VRAM Switcher 使用前须知：执行本地任务时会停止本地 LLM；当前 DSH 回复仍使用该模型时不要获取 GPU 租约。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-plugin/index.js:205-211","vram_switcher/orchestrator.py:321-326"]}
